&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: India (Bangalore / Mumbai / Delhi)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Rubrik has partnered with the World’s leading Regional Systems Integrators to develop successful and profitable outcomes for our joint customers, and for our respective companies. The India Channel Development Manager will be responsible for managing and driving unprecedented growth with select Regional Systems Integrators in India. This person would come to the role with a successful track-record of managing successful partnerships, including; service creation, enablement, cost models, financial selling, and business negotiations. This candidate will lead from the front, communicate openly, and set the example of a positive and collaborative work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
